    "caption": "your sign to host an epic { Halloween Game Night }  Minute -to-win- it games:  Candy Corn Chaos [ using a spoon in your mouth, transfer candy corn from a bowl into a cup with your hands behind your back ] Balloons up - Eyes In [ keep a balloon up while moving plastic eyeballs from the ground into a bucket ] Heads, Shoulders, Knees - EYES [ count your players. Put one eyeball for each player MINUS ONE on the table. Host calls \u201chead, shoulder, knees\u201d in random order and speeds. When \u201cEYE\u201d is called, each player tries to grab an eyeball. 1 person is eliminated each round - remove an eyeball too. Winner is the last one with an eyeball ]  Photo Scavenger Hunt [ this was simple with Chat. I just had it make a scavenger hunt for items in our yard and make it Halloween themed. Teams take pics of each item and first team with a completed list wins ] Cupcake Wars - it\u2019s a mess but so fun!  Everything I used is linked in my Amazon storefront! Have fun!",
