    "caption": "Can you squat, jump, and step sideways without dropping a balloon held with just one finger? This Balloon Circle Challenge is a group game that puts everyone\u2019s coordination and teamwork to the test! How to play: \u2022 Stand in a circle with a balloon between each pair of neighboring players. \u2022 Each player uses just one finger to help hold the balloon between them. \u2022 A moderator calls out commands like \u201cstep right,\u201d \u201csquat down,\u201d or \u201cjump.\u201d \u2022 Follow every command while keeping the balloons in place. \u2022 If you drop a balloon, you\u2019re eliminated! Try this balloon party game for a youth group, family gathering, or team-building activity. One wrong move could send your balloon\u2014and your chances\u2014straight to the floor! Which command would get you out: squat, jump, or step right? Tell us below! Subscribe to Dig the Games for more group games, party games, family games, and team challenges! #BalloonGames #GroupGames #PartyGames #TeamBuildingGames #DigTheGames",
